<title>UK: Moorfield says can answer Greycoat questions.</title>
<headline>Moorfield says can answer Greycoat questions.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK property group Moorfield Estates Plc said on Friday it had reviewed with its advisers questions put to it by Greycoat Plc about a proposed merger of the two and these could be answered in full.</p>
<p>&quot;(They) have not highlighted any issues of material concern regarding the proposed structure of the merger,&quot; Moorfield said in a statement.</p>
</text>
